# Voice validation

Follow the repository root `AGENTS.md` Automated voice validation requirements and
`tools/voice-test-candidate/README.md`. These are completion requirements for agents, not optional
owner acceptance checks. Use the existing candidate to listen and speak in a browser; run relevant
scenarios, inspect reports/audio/conversation/application logs, fix in-scope failures and rerun.
Do not replace audio validation with API-only checks, inserted transcripts or routine owner mic tests.
Preserve other worktrees/services; default to isolated local development and bounded runs. Report exact
evidence and honest outcomes. Production needs explicit user authorization. Human help is limited to
unresolvable prerequisites, hardware or subjective checks, with an explanation of the specific need.
